leading-tight">29<!-- --> min</span></a></li><li><a href="https://www.flydenver.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-md bg-[color:var(--color-energy)]/12 border border-[color:var(--color-energy)]/40 px-2 py-1.5 text-center h-full transition hover:bg-[color:var(--color-energy)]/20 hover:border-[color:var(--color-energy)] hover:-translate-y-0.5"><span class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]/75 leading-tight">Denver Airport</span><span class="block font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-[color:var(--color-energy-deep)] leading-tight">30<!-- --> min</span></a></li><li><a href="https://www.botanicgardens.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-md bg-[color:var(--color-energy)]/12 border border-[color:var(--color-energy)]/40 px-2 py-1.5 text-center h-full transition hover:bg-[color:var(--color-energy)]/20 hover:border-[color:var(--color-energy)] hover:-translate-y-0.5"><span class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]/75 leading-tight">Denver Botanic Gardens</span><span class="block font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-[color:var(--color-energy-deep)] leading-tight">30<!-- --> min</span></a></li><li><a href="https://www.denverartmuseum.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-md bg-[color:var(--color-energy)]/12 border border-[color:var(--color-energy)]/40 px-2 py-1.5 text-center h-full transition hover:bg-[color:var(--color-energy)]/20 hover:border-[color:var(--color-energy)] hover:-translate-y-0.5"><span class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]/75 leading-tight">Denver Art Museum</span><span class="block font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-[color:var(--color-energy-deep)] leading-tight">30<!-- --> min</span></a></li></ul><p class="mt-2.5 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-ink)]/55">Driving times via OpenStreetMap routing. Traffic varies.</p></section><section class="mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-accent)]/25 bg-[color:var(--color-accent)]/[0.08] p-7 sm:p-9"><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[color:var(--color-accent-deep)] text-center mb-5">Why Guests Love It Here</h2><div class="prose-kk text-[color:var(--color-accent-deep)]"><div style="line-height:1.7;font-size:1.05rem"><p>💨 6BR, 5.5BA 420friendly KushKations home in Thornton with private baths for 5 bedrooms, indoor golf simulator, theater space, kids game zone, hot tub, 4-person wooden infrared sauna cabin, and propane grill — 20 min to DIA and 25 min to Downtown Denver</p><p>🛋 Spacious, thoughtfully designed layout with multiple living areas, workspaces, and entertainment zones — ideal for big groups and retreats<br/>🍽 Chef-style kitchen with expansive granite countertops and high-end appliances, flowing into a large dining area with multiple tables<br/>🎬 Dedicated upper-floor theater room with 75" TV, reclining chairs, popcorn machine, and balcony with a swing<br/>🏀 Main-floor game zone with full golf simulator, basketball hoops, Street Fighter II arcade, board games, and Smart TV<br/>🧸 Downstairs kids zone with pool table, 2 arcades (Joust + Dig Dug), air hockey, and foosball<br/>🌳 Private outdoor oasis with shaded seating, hot tub, propane grill, and horseshoes yard game</p><p>📍 Nearby (drive times / typical Uber est.)<br/>🏟 Empower Field (Broncos Stadium): 20 min<br/>✈ DIA: 20 min<br/>🏟 Ball Arena (Pepsi Center): 24 min<br/>🏙 Downtown Denver: 25 min<br/>🎸 Red Rocks: 30 min</p><p>🛋 The Space / Living Room<br/>🛋 Central living room with a super comfortable couch for lounging and movie nights<br/>📺 55" Smart TV for streaming shows and games<br/>💻 Dedicated computer desk with monitor for remote work or trip planning<br/>🏠 Cozy hub connecting naturally to the kitchen and dining areas</p><p>🍽 Kitchen &amp; Dining Area<br/>🪨 Fully equipped kitchen with expansive granite countertops and top-notch appliances<br/>🥞 Great for quick breakfasts or full dinners and holiday spreads<br/>🍽 Multiple elegant dining tables with generous seating so everyone can eat together<br/>🔄 Open concept keeps the cook connected with the group</p><p>🛌 Bedrooms &amp; Bed Setup (6 total)<br/>🛏 KushKations Palace includes 6 bedrooms with 5 private/dedicated bathrooms for privacy and comfort</p><p>🟦 Main Floor<br/>🛏 Bedroom 1: King bed + ensuite bathroom (peaceful retreat off the main level)<br/>🧺 Half bath near the laundry room (washer, dryer, sink) for shared use</p><p>🟨 Upstairs<br/>👑 Primary Suite: King bed + sleep sofa bed (pull-out)<br/>🚿 Private ensuite with double sinks, tub, separate shower, and toilet<br/>👗 Massive walk-in closet + two comfy armchairs<br/>📺 55" Smart TV for in-room streaming</p><p>🛏 Bedroom 3: Two queen beds + private ensuite full bathroom + 50" Smart TV<br/>🛏 Bedroom 4: One queen bed + desk + 32" Smart TV<br/>🚿 Full bathroom just beside Bedroom 4 (functions like a near-private bath)</p><p>🟩 Downstairs<br/>🛏 Bedroom 5: One queen bed + 32" Smart TV + full bathroom just outside the room<br/>🛌 Bedroom 6 (Bunk Room): Three bunk beds + 32" Smart TV</p><p>🧺 Every bedroom includes closets, hangers, and laundry baskets so guests can unpack and settle in</p><p>🛁 Bathrooms (5.5)<br/>🚿 5 full bathrooms + 1 half bath throughout the home<br/>🔒 Multiple ensuites for privacy and convenience<br/>🛁 Mix of tubs, walk-in showers, and double-sink vanities in primary baths<br/>🧴 Stocked with hair dryers, plush towels, and shower essentials (shampoo, conditioner, body wash)</p><p>🎬 Theater Area<br/>📺 Upper-floor theater with a massive 75" TV<br/>🪑 Six plush reclining theater seats for a true cinema experience<br/>🍿 Popcorn machine for movie-night snacks<br/>🪟 Balcony access with a cozy swing for fresh air between episodes</p><p>🎯 Main-Floor Game Room (Golf Simulator Zone)<br/>🏌 Golf simulator with realistic graphics and swing analysis<br/>🏀 Basketball hoops + Street Fighter II arcade<br/>📺 40" Smart TV for background games, music videos, or streaming</p><p>🧸 Kids Zone / Downstairs Game Area<br/>🎱 Pool table for tournaments and casual matches<br/>🧖 4-person wooden infrared sauna cabin<br/>🕹 Two arcade machines (Joust + Dig Dug)<br/>🏒 Air hockey for head-to-head play<br/>📺 50" Smart TV for streaming, console games, or movie nights</p><p>🌳 Outdoor Oasis<br/>🌿 Private outdoor retreat for relaxing and hanging out<br/>⛱ Shaded awning with comfortable seating<br/>♨ Hot tub for soaking and unwinding<br/>🧲 Horseshoes area for friendly competition<br/>🔥 Propane grill for cookouts (Guests need to either provide their own propane gas or utilize the Cynch application to place an order.)</p><p>🚗 Parking<br/>🚙 Driveway + neighborhood parking for multiple vehicles<br/>✅ No additional parking fees</p><p>🚕 Getting Around<br/>🚕 Uber/Lyft are common for Downtown Denver, shopping/dining, or Red Rocks shuttles<br/>🛣 Quick access to major roads and highways for Denver, DIA, Boulder, and the mountains<br/>🚌 RTD park-and-ride and bus options within a reasonable drive</p><p>📌 Other Things to Note<br/>💨 420friendly indoors KushKations property; cigarettes/tobacco outdoors only (please follow posted house rules)<br/>⏰ Early check-in / late check-out may be available for an additional fee (based on schedule/availability)<br/>🪪 ID verification via ChargeAutomation + rental agreement required prior to check-in<br/>🔑 Key details sent before arrival (access info + house guidelines) so check-in is smooth and simple as possible.</p><p>🧾 **STR license number: 103518</p></div></div></section><section class="mt-16 rounded-2xl bg-[color:var(--color-cream-soft)] border border-[color:var(--color-line)] p-7 sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span class="font-display font-bold text-5xl sm:text-6xl leading-none kk-sweep-text">4.80</span><div><p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--color-gold)] tracking-widest leading-none">★★★★★</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink)]/65">44<!-- --> guest reviews</p>