uest reviews\",\"staysEyebrow\":\"All {n} houses\",\"staysTitle\":\"Pick Your House. Tap What You Need.\",\"staysSub\":\"Filter by hot tub, theater, sauna, game room — the whole Denver lineup, one scroll.\",\"whyCaption\":\"Nights You Book Direct.\",\"whyEyebrow\":\"Book Direct, not through a platform\",\"whyTitle\":\"A Lower Total Price, a Real Host on the Other End.\",\"why1Title\":\"No platform fees\",\"why1Body\":\"Airbnb and VRBO stack their service fees on top of the rate. Direct, you skip them — same house, lower total.\",\"why2Title\":\"A real host\",\"why2Body\":\"No black-box support tickets. You talk to the team that owns the houses, before and during your stay.\",\"why3Title\":\"Repeat-guest perks\",\"why3Body\":\"Members of the direct list see member rates and early access on new properties as they open.\",\"browseAll\":\"Browse All Properties\",\"howEyebrow\":\"How it works\",\"howTitle\":\"From Search to Check-In.\",\"step1Title\":\"Find Your House\",\"step1Body\":\"Search by dates and group size — only KushKations houses, with real availability.\",\"step2Title\":\"Book Direct\",\"step2Body\":\"Reserve and pay on KushKations — no platform fees, best total price. Quick ID check in one link.\",\"step3Title\":\"Arrive\",\"step3Body\":\"Door code on the morning of check-in. The keys to Denver, ready when you are.\",\"reviewsBandAcross\":\"across {count}+ guest reviews\",\"readReviews\":\"Read guest reviews\",\"denverEyebrow\":\"The neighborhood\",\"denverTitle\":\"Built for the Denver Trip You're Picturing.\",\"landmarkRedRocks\":\"The night you came to Denver for.\",\"landmarkBallArena\":\"Nuggets, Avs, every tour that matters.\",\"landmarkEmpower\":\"Sundays, sold-out shows, and tailgates.\",\"landmarkDowntown\":\"Dinner, bars, late-night, the 16th Street Mall.\",\"landmarkFoothills\":\"Boulder, Golden, Evergreen — a short drive to the air.\",\"landmarkAirport\":\"Houses minutes from the curb, made for fly-in groups.\"},\"property\":{\"reviewsWord\":\"Reviews\",\"guestReviews\":\"guest reviews\",\"loadedWith\":\"What This Place Is Loaded With\",\"whereSleep\":\"Where Everyone Sleeps\",\"sleeps\":\"Sleeps {n}\",\"bedroom\":\"Bedroom\",\"bedrooms\":\"Bedrooms\",\"bath\":\"Bath\",\"baths\":\"Baths\",\"fullBath\":\"Full Bath\",\"fullBaths\":\"Full Baths\",\"halfBath\":\"Half Bath\",\"halfBaths\":\"Half Baths\",\"howClose\":\"How Close to the City\",\"tapSpot\":\"Tap any spot to open its website\",\"min\":\"min\",\"drivingNote\":\"Driving times via OpenStreetMap routing. Traffic varies.\",\"whyLove\":\"Why Guests Love It Here\",\"everythingInHouse\":\"Everything in the House\",\"theArea\":\"The area\",\"redRocksDesc\":\"Colorado's most iconic stage — and one of the reasons guests book here.\",\"redRocksMin\":\"About {n} minutes from the house.\",\"bookingWith\":\"Booking with KushKations\",\"secureCheckIn\":\"A Quick, Secure Check-In\",\"checkIn1Bold\":\"420-friendly indoors.\",\"checkIn1Rest\":\"Smoking and tobacco use outdoors only — keeps the house perfect for the next group.\",\"checkIn2Bold\":\"ID + agreement before check-in.\",\"checkIn2Rest\":\"Every guest completes a quick ID check, signs the rental agreement, and authorizes a refundable security deposit hold. One secure link, a few minutes — same standard as any boutique hospitality brand.\",\"checkIn3Bold\":\"Door code on arrival.\",\"checkIn3Rest\":\"No keys to swap, no front-desk hassle. You're in the door the minute check-in opens.\",\"gallery\":\"Gallery\",\"allPhotos\":\"All {n} Photos\",\"galleryNote\":\"Tap any photo to open the gallery — swipe through and pinch/click to zoom.\"},\"booking\":{\"checkYourDates\":\"Check your dates\",\"selectDatesForPrice\":\"Select dates for your price\",\"bestTotalPrice\":\"Best total price · no platform fees\",\"selectToSeePrice\":\"Select your dates \u0026 guests to see your price\",\"freeToCheck\":\"Free to check — no charge until you confirm.\",\"cancellation\":\"Cancellation:\",\"cancellationText\":\"97% refunded 