🛋 Spacious, thoughtfully designed layout with multiple living areas, workspaces, and entertainment zones — ideal for big groups and retreats\u003cbr/\u003e🍽 Chef-style kitchen with expansive granite countertops and high-end appliances, flowing into a large dining area with multiple tables\u003cbr/\u003e🎬 Dedicated upper-floor theater room with 75\" TV, reclining chairs, popcorn machine, and balcony with a swing\u003cbr/\u003e🏀 Main-floor game zone with full golf simulator, basketball hoops, Street Fighter II arcade, board games, and Smart TV\u003cbr/\u003e🧸 Downstairs kids zone with pool table, 2 arcades (Joust + Dig Dug), air hockey, and foosball\u003cbr/\u003e🌳 Private outdoor oasis with shaded seating, hot tub, propane grill, and horseshoes yard game\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📍 Nearby (drive times / typical Uber est.)\u003cbr/\u003e🏟 Empower Field (Broncos Stadium): 20 min\u003cbr/\u003e✈ DIA: 20 min\u003cbr/\u003e🏟 Ball Arena (Pepsi Center): 24 min\u003cbr/\u003e🏙 Downtown Denver: 25 min\u003cbr/\u003e🎸 Red Rocks: 30 min\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🛋 The Space / Living Room\u003cbr/\u003e🛋 Central living room with a super comfortable couch for lounging and movie nights\u003cbr/\u003e📺 55\" Smart TV for streaming shows and games\u003cbr/\u003e💻 Dedicated computer desk with monitor for remote work or trip planning\u003cbr/\u003e🏠 Cozy hub connecting naturally to the kitchen and dining areas\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🍽 Kitchen \u0026amp; Dining Area\u003cbr/\u003e🪨 Fully equipped kitchen with expansive granite countertops and top-notch appliances\u003cbr/\u003e🥞 Great for quick breakfasts or full dinners and holiday spreads\u003cbr/\u003e🍽 Multiple elegant dining tables with generous seating so everyone can eat together\u003cbr/\u003e🔄 Open concept keeps the cook connected with the group\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🛌 Bedrooms \u0026amp; Bed Setup (6 total)\u003cbr/\u003e🛏 KushKations Palace includes 6 bedrooms with 5 private/dedicated bathrooms for privacy and comfort\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🟦 Main Floor\u003cbr/\u003e🛏 Bedroom 1: King bed + ensuite bathroom (peaceful retreat off the main level)\u003cbr/\u003e🧺 Half bath near the laundry room (washer, dryer, sink) for shared use\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🟨 Upstairs\u003cbr/\u003e👑 Primary Suite: King bed + sleep sofa bed (pull-out)\u003cbr/\u003e🚿 Private ensuite with double sinks, tub, separate shower, and toilet\u003cbr/\u003e👗 Massive walk-in closet + two comfy armchairs\u003cbr/\u003e📺 55\" Smart TV for in-room streaming\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🛏 Bedroom 3: Two queen beds + private ensuite full bathroom + 50\" Smart TV\u003cbr/\u003e🛏 Bedroom 4: One queen bed + desk + 32\" Smart TV\u003cbr/\u003e🚿 Full bathroom just beside Bedroom 4 (functions like a near-private bath)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🟩 Downstairs\u003cbr/\u003e🛏 Bedroom 5: One queen bed + 32\" Smart TV + full bathroom just outside the room\u003cbr/\u003e🛌 Bedroom 6 (Bunk Room): Three bunk beds + 32\" Smart TV\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🧺 Every bedroom includes closets, hangers, and laundry baskets so guests can unpack and settle in\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🛁 Bathrooms (5.5)\u003cbr/\u003e🚿 5 full bathrooms + 1 half bath throughout the home\u003cbr/\u003e🔒 Multiple ensuites for privacy and convenience\u003cbr/\u003e🛁 Mix of tubs, walk-in showers, and double-sink vanities in primary baths\u003cbr/\u003e🧴 Stocked with hair dryers, plush towels, and shower essentials (shampoo, conditioner, body wash)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎬 Theater Area\u003cbr/\u003e📺 Upper-floor theater with a massive 75\" TV\u003cbr/\u003e🪑 Six plush reclining theater seats for a true cinema experience\u003cbr/\u003e🍿 Popcorn machine for movie-night snacks\u003cbr/\u003e🪟 Balcony access with a cozy swing for fresh air between episodes\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎯 Main-Floor Game Room (Golf Simulator Zone)\u003cbr/\u003e🏌 Golf simulator with realistic graphics and swing analysis\u003cbr/\u003e🏀 Basketball hoops + Street Fighter II arcade\u003cbr/\u003e📺 40\" Smart TV for background games, music videos, or streaming\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🧸 Kids Zone / Downstairs Game Area\u003cbr/\u003e🎱 Pool table for tournaments and casual matches\u003cbr/\u003e🧖 4-person wooden infrared sauna cabin\u003cbr/\u003e🕹 Two arcade machines (Joust + Dig Dug)\u003cbr/\u003e🏒 Air hockey for head-to-head play\u003cbr/\u003e📺 50\" Smart TV for streaming, console games, or movie nights\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🌳 Outdoor Oasis\u003cbr/\u003e🌿 Private outdoor retreat for relaxing and hanging out\u003cbr/\u003e⛱ Shaded awning with comfortable seating\u003cbr/\u003e♨ Hot tub for soaking and unwinding\u003cbr/\u003e🧲 Horseshoes area for friendly competition\u003cbr/\u003e🔥 Propane grill for cookouts (Guests need to either provide their own propane gas or utilize the Cynch application to place an order.)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚗 Parking\u003cbr/\u003e🚙 Driveway + neighborhood parking for multiple vehicles\u003cbr/\u003e✅ No additional parking fees\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚕 Getting Around\u003cbr/\u003e🚕 Uber/Lyft are common for Downtown Denver, shopping/dining, or Red Rocks shuttles\u003cbr/\u003e🛣 Quick access to major roads and highways for Denver, DIA, Boulder, and the mountains\u003cbr/\u003e🚌 RTD park-and-ride and bus options within a reasonable drive\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📌 Other Things to Note\u003cbr/\u003e💨 420friendly indoors KushKations property; cigarettes/tobacco outdoors only (please follow posted house rules)\u003cbr/\u003e⏰ Early check-in / late check-out may be available for an additional fee (based on schedule/availability)\u003cbr/\u003e🪪 ID verification via ChargeAutomation + rental agreement required prior to check-in\u003cbr/\u003e🔑 Key details sent before arrival (access info + house guidelines) so check-in is smooth and simple as possible.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🧾 **STR license number: 103518\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3b:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-14